| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |  Sort: count(*) DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |   Projection: hits.AdvEngineID, count(Int64(1)) AS count(*)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.AdvEngineID]], aggr=[[count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       Filter: hits.AdvEngineID != Int64(0)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[AdvEngineID], partial_filters=[hits.AdvEngineID != Int64(0)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=spice.ai compute_context=url=https://us-east-1-prod-aws-flight.spiceai.io,username=,org=spiceai,app=benchmarks-clickbench base_sql=SELECT "AdvEngineID", count(1) AS "count(*)" FROM "clickbench"."hits" WHERE ("hits"."AdvEngineID" <> 0) AND ("hits"."AdvEngineID" <> 0) GROUP BY "hits"."AdvEngineID" ORDER BY "count(*)" DESC NULLS FIRST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
